## Key rules

- `self:getVariable()` returns `""` not `nil` when missing
- `self:updateView()` values must be strings — use `tostring(n)`
- Never use `fibaro.sleep` — it blocks everything; use `setTimeout`/`setInterval`
- Online runs exit when idle — use `--%%keep-alive:true` (or proxy mode) to stay alive waiting for HC3 events
- The QA ids the emulator assigns start at 5000; in proxy mode the QA runs under the proxy's HC3 id
